> a scalar td){
>         real scalar v
>         v = td.attr[i] + td.attr[j]
>         return(G.has_edge(i,j) ? -v : v)
> }

: 
: /*
>         Directed sender covariate: sum over arcs of the SENDER's covariate
>         value (attr[tail]) - equivalently attr . outdegree. Directed only.
> */
